\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Rejoice and be glad! 
\par the Redeemer hath come:
\par Go, look on His cradle, 
\par His cross, and His tomb.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Sound His praises, tell the story
\par of Him who was slain;
\par Sound His praises, tell with gladness
\par He liveth again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Rejoice and be glad!
\par It is sunshine at last;
\par The clouds have departed,
\par the shadows are past.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Sound His praises, tell the story
\par of Him who was slain;
\par Sound His praises, tell with gladness
\par He liveth again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Rejoice and be glad!
\par for the blood hath been shed;
\par Redemption is finished, 
\par the price hath been paid.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Sound His praises, tell the story
\par of Him who was slain;
\par Sound His praises, tell with gladness
\par He liveth again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Rejoice and be glad!
\par now the pardon is free;
\par The just for the unjust
\par hath died on the tree.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Sound His praises, tell the story
\par of Him who was slain;
\par Sound His praises, tell with gladness
\par He liveth again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Rejoice and be glad!
\par for the Lamb that was slain,
\par O'er death is triumphant, 
\par and liveth again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Sound His praises, tell the story
\par of Him who was slain;
\par Sound His praises, tell with gladness
\par He liveth again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Rejoice and be glad!
\par for our King is on high;
\par He pleadeth for us on 
\par His throne in the sky.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Sound His praises, tell the story
\par of Him who was slain;
\par Sound His praises, tell with gladness
\par He liveth again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Rejoice and be glad!
\par for He cometh again;
\par He cometh in glory,
\par the Lamb that was slain.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Sound His praises, tell the story
\par of Him who was slain;
\par Sound His praises, tell with gladness
\par He liveth again.
\par \f1 
